358
00:19:40,430 --> 00:19:42,641
Yang dibicarakan Pak Walikota...
Halo, Pak.

359
00:19:42,724 --> 00:19:45,352
Pak Walikota bicara
soal kebijakan. Oke?

360
00:19:45,435 --> 00:19:48,605
Jika kau tidak mau aku
di sini tanpa masker,

361
00:19:48,688 --> 00:19:50,607
