melawan tetanggamu

412
00:22:42,320 --> 00:22:44,072
dan... keluargamu?

413
00:22:45,865 --> 00:22:48,367
Karena... itulah arti
komunitas, bukan?

414
00:22:48,701 --> 00:22:50,578
Komunitas itu keluarga. Oke?

415
00:22:51,037 --> 00:22:53,999
Karena kau bisa merusak
hari seseorang

416
00:22:54,082 --> 00:22:57,085
