omong kosong apa pun yang kau mau.

436
00:23:59,438 --> 00:24:01,191
Wow. Berapa banyak kau minum, Nak?

437
00:24:01,274 --> 00:24:02,817
Um, jujur saja, sebenarnya,

438
00:24:02,900 --> 00:24:04,235
