1711
01:36:46,426 --> 01:36:48,762
Uh, selamat siang,
Bapak-bapak dan Ibu-ibu.

1712
01:36:48,845 --> 01:36:52,349
Namaku Joe Cross.
Joseph Cross.

1713
01:36:52,432 --> 01:36:54,059
Sheriff dari Sevilla County.

1714
01:36:54,893 --> 01:36:58,313
Tadi malam sekitar tengah malam,

1715
